VITE_DEV_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Multi-tenancy, local — path-prefix over one origin (no subdomains):
#   http://localhost:5173/admin     → master control
#   http://localhost:5173/{slug}/   → that tenant's app
# The SPA reads its slug from its own path prefix (lib/tenancy.ts) and sends
# it as X-Tenant-Slug on every API call — nothing per-domain is baked into
# the build. The compile-time VITE_TENANCY_CENTRAL_PREFIX is only needed when
# the backend's TENANCY_CENTRAL_PREFIX (backend/.env) isn't "admin".
